From: shaohong.dong <shaohong.dong.cq@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: enable selected IMX708 native application

Include the validated CAM3 CCI1/master1 and native CAMSS wiring only when this
application is selected. The selected application also supplies the CCI completion fix.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [application-specific board configuration]
Signed-off-by: shaohong.dong <shaohong.dong.cq@gmail.com>
---
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/qcs6490-radxa-dragon-q6a.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/qcs6490-radxa-dragon-q6a.dts
@@ -1247,3 +1247,5 @@
 	bias-pull-up;
 	drive-strength = <10>;
 };
+
+#include "q6a-imx708-native.dtsi"
